// The reference body's rig (Quaternius's Superhero Male, which Hakuro was measured on), as
// engine::humanoid's `rig_of` reads it from its GLB with the `UNREAL` names: written out here as
// literals by /mnt/project-files/hakuro-fit/gen_rig.py, so the moves fitted to that rig
// (content/moves) play on Hakuro with no file loaded. Its joints are his skeleton's, so each of
// its bones moves one of his (`HAKURO_BONE`).

use engine::humanoid::{NONE, Rig, RigBone, Rigid}
use std::quat::Quat

